OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785872169
OL,3,CParents' anger over nursery school
OL,4,Cuncertainty
OL,6,FParents in Co Down say they have been
OL,7,Fleft angry and frustrated after
OL,8,Fanother twist in the future of a
OL,9,Fnursery and day care facility in
OL,10,FDromore.
OL,12,FJolly Jesters first announced it was
OL,13,Fclosing with just days' notice before
OL,14,Ffamilies were told a buyer had been
OL,15,Ffound and the nursery would continue
OL,16,Foperating. However, that deal has
OL,17,Fsince fallen through, leaving the
OL,18,Ffuture of the nursery uncertain once
OL,19,Fagain.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
