PN,41202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785872169
OL,3,CParents' anger over nursery school
OL,4,Cuncertainty
OL,6,FFamilies say it is the third change of
OL,7,Fdirection in a matter of days, leaving
OL,8,Fthem unsure of what happens next.
OL,10,FFor five years, Jolly Jesters has been
OL,11,Fa huge part of Kristofer's daily
OL,12,Froutine.
OL,14,FHis mum, Claire, says he loves
OL,15,Fattending the nursery and, like many
OL,16,Fparents, the family is now left
OL,17,Fwaiting for answers about its future.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
