FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785872169
OL,3,CParents' anger over nursery school
OL,4,Cuncertainty
OL,6,FLast week, parents were told the
OL,7,Fnursery would close permanently
OL,8,Fbecause it was no longer financially
OL,9,Fviable.
OL,11,FThen came news that a buyer had
OL,12,Fapparently been found and the nursery
OL,13,Fwould continue operating but that
OL,14,Fwasn't to be.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785872169
OL,3,CParents' anger over nursery school
OL,4,Cuncertainty
OL,6,FIn a statement to UTV, the owners of
OL,7,FJolly Jesters apologised to families,
OL,8,Fsaying they "tried everything to keep
OL,9,Fthe nursery afloat" and had
OL,10,F"personally funded the nursery for
OL,11,Fapproximately 18 months" while
OL,12,Fcontinuing to invest in improvements
OL,13,Fand cover running costs.
OL,15,FThey said a planned sale to an
OL,16,Festablished operator fell through
OL,17,Fweeks before completion, while a
OL,18,Fsecond potential buyer who had
OL,19,Fverbally agreed to take over later
OL,20,Fwithdrew.
OL,26,@pD@MOUqD@SO]rD@AOUsD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785872169
OL,3,CParents' anger over nursery school
OL,4,Cuncertainty
OL,6,FThe owners described the closure as
OL,7,F"the last thing" they wanted, adding
OL,8,Fthat the decision was only taken once
OL,9,Fthey were satisfied staff wages would
OL,10,Fbe paid in full and parents would not
OL,11,Fbe charged for childcare that could
OL,12,Fnot be provided.
OL,14,FThey also said discussions are
OL,15,Fcontinuing with another experienced
OL,16,Foperator about a possible reopening,
OL,17,Fbut stressed these talks are "at an
OL,18,Fearly stage" and that they "cannot
OL,19,Fmake any guarantees regarding whether
OL,20,For when this may happen".
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@PO]yD@^OUzD@LO]zD@\OU|D@XO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785872169
OL,3,CParents' anger over nursery school
OL,4,Cuncertainty
OL,6,FThe owners added: "We fully understand
OL,7,Fthe potential stress and inconvenience
OL,8,Fthis has caused families, and we are
OL,9,Fgenuinely sorry for this as it was
OL,10,Fnever our intention."
OL,12,FThe uncertainty facing families has
OL,13,Falso sparked wider questions about
OL,14,Fwhether there is enough support in
OL,15,Fplace from the Executive when a
OL,16,Fchildcare provider suddenly closes its
OL,17,Fdoors, with some parents calling for
OL,18,Fgreater protections and contingency
OL,19,Fplanning for families affected by
OL,20,Funexpected closures.
OL,26,@nD@SOUrD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/9
