PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785872169
OL,3,CParents' anger over nursery school
OL,4,Cuncertainty
OL,6,FA Department of Education spokesperson
OL,7,Fsaid: "Childcare provision in Northern
OL,8,FIreland is delivered primarily through
OL,9,Fprivate businesses, voluntary
OL,10,Forganisations or childminders, and
OL,11,Fproviders are responsible for managing
OL,12,Ftheir own financial sustainability.
OL,14,F"The Department of Education has no
OL,15,Fstatutory authority to intervene in
OL,16,Fcommercial decisions relating to the
OL,17,Fownership or operation of private
OL,18,Fbusinesses."
OL,26,@oD@GOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/9
