PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785872169
OL,3,CParents' anger over nursery school
OL,4,Cuncertainty
OL,6,F"The Department became aware of the
OL,7,Fsituation from a parent on Friday 31
OL,8,FJuly. The Early Years Organisation,
OL,9,Fresponsible for administering the
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland Childcare Subsidy
OL,11,FScheme, has reached out to the parents
OL,12,Finvolved to help them transfer their
OL,13,Faccounts to alternative childcare
OL,14,Fproviders.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G8/9
