OL,3,CParents' anger over nursery school
OL,4,Cuncertainty
OL,6,F"The draft Executive Early Learning
OL,7,Fand Childcare Strategy contains a
OL,8,Frange of actions to support the early
OL,9,Flearning and childcare sector.
OL,10,FImplementation of actions are subject
OL,11,Fto approval and the availability of
OL,12,Fthe appropriate funding."
